          "text": "Why was the vice president taking part(participating) in that project?"
        },
        {
          "n": "63",
          "text": "She is in charge, isn't she?"
        },
        {
          "n": "64",
          "text": "He is not on this plane, is he?"
        },
        {
          "n": "65",
          "text": "She was different from most of the girls, wasn't she?"
        },
